        <mxCell id="principles" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#334155;" value="RELIABILITY CONTRACT&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At-least-once execution + idempotent business writes&lt;br&gt;Business state and approved send jobs persist in PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;Uncertain sends are reconciled, never blindly retried&lt;br&gt;No synchronous API-to-Worker dependency" vertex="1">
